# HIGHMARK — PROJECT PLAN & ROADMAP

## PRINCIPLES

* Build in small, releasable chunks
* Each feature must be demoable
* Prioritize revenue and onboarding speed
* Keep Claude sessions small to save credits
* Start new Claude session when:

  * Task > 1 feature
  * Context gets messy
  * You switch domains (backend → frontend → infra)

